    "name": "Scouts",
    "review_state": "approved",
    "reviewed_at": "2026-09-15T04:35:16Z",
    "reviewed_by": "claude-sonnet-5-reviewer",
    "summary": "Takes the form Scouts X\". In the Resolve Pre-battle Abilities step, if every model in a unit has this ability, do one of: if the unit is in strategic reserves, set it up anywhere wholly within your deployment zone; if it is wholly within your deployment zone, it makes a scout move; if it is embarked in a DEDICATED TRANSPORT wholly within your deployment zone and every embarked model has Scouts, that transport makes a scout move. A scout move is up to X\" using the Moving rules; after it, the unit must be more than 8\" horizontally from all enemy units."
  },
